  "description": "External: (Carnaby Street Elevation)\n\nApplication of a ‘Topcret’ wall coating in beige colour.\nInstallation of lower cladding Carrara stone.\nPowder coated paint the existing doors.\nInstallation of a blade sign pivoting on a hinge to comply with the City of Westminster guidelines.\n“Edikted” sign mounted with lighting to comply with the City of Westminster guidelines.\nConstruction of a continuation built-in planter to match the existing planter located on adjacent building.\n\n\nExternal: (Kingly Street Elevation)\n\nInstallation of blade sign pivoting on hinge to comply with City of Westminster guidelines.\nPainting of existing metal window frames in rust-tone colour.\nRemoval of existing paint and exposure of the original bricks.\nInstallation of “Edikted” sign. Lighting to comply with the City of Westminster guidelines.\n“EDIKTED” graffiti text to be installed on facade.\nReplacing existing frame around entrance door and apply four-colour gradient paint finish.\nExisting aluminium door to be powder-coated in dark pink colour.\n\n\nInternal:\n\nAlteration to MEP\nNew floor, walls and decoration.\nNew lighting.\nNew furniture both freestanding and built in.",
